  "common_checks": [
    "separate VMs boot read-only with no shared filesystem; gateway Tor starts disabled",
    "private virtio control configures the production supervisor; API child has UID 1300, no capabilities, no environment and no core dumps",
    "chat reaches the production API broker; token checked; disabled Tor fails closed",
    "root in the chat cannot reach listening administration/SOCKS sockets or forward TCP, DNS, UDP/QUIC and IPv6",
    "API process UID cannot connect directly to a public IP",
    "external packet capture sees zero IP packets before Tor activation, including startup and bypass probes",
    "crashing Tor makes API calls fail without a direct fallback",
    "revocation closes the listener and the next API instance rejects the previous token",
    "control fault disconnect removes the broker and stops Tor without automatic restart",
    "gateway termination leaves the chat without an alternative network path",
    "synthetic provider credential never appears in either VM console log",
    "complete external capture contains only TCP after Tor activation and no UDP or IPv6"
  ],
